Depends: ${misc:Depends}, docker.io | docker-ce, systemd, adduser, passwd, ca-certificates, nvidia-container-toolkit | nvidia-container-runtime
Description: LMRS container runner with bundled vLLM and LMCache
 Installs the host-side contract for running LMRS from a Docker Hub image.
 The image contains the LMRS server, vLLM, and LMCache. The host keeps only
 settings, certificates, data, and logs mounted into the container. The package
 creates lmrsuser:lmrsgrp, pulls the configured image, and starts the service.
